Built on AutoSubs
-----------------
AutoSubs — "On-device subtitle generation that connects directly to DaVinci
Resolve, Premiere, and After Effects" — by tmoroney and contributors:
https://github.com/tmoroney/auto-subs

AutoSubs is MIT licensed (see its repository for the full text).

ScriptAlign invokes the `autosubs` command-line interface and reads the JSON
word timings that AutoSubs writes. No AutoSubs source code is included in this
repository. ScriptAlign is an independent project and is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by AutoSubs or its authors.

The alignment, script re-flow, bilingual pairing, diagnostics, desktop UI and
SRT generation in this repository are original to ScriptAlign.
